    <briefdescription>
<para>Slow streaming mock plugin. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Emits <computeroutput>num_tokens</computeroutput> tokens via stream_callback, sleeping <computeroutput>token_delay_ms</computeroutput> between each one. This makes it possible to cancel mid-stream. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
